    `the public holidays` IS A LIST OF DATE @desc Which dates are public holidays in the days after the lodgment?
    `the person took all reasonable steps to make the document available within a reasonable period` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you take all reasonable steps to make the document available, within a reasonable period, to the applicants who indicated that they wish to obtain, or who arranged to receive, a copy?
