    IF `the person gave the applicants written notice of how to obtain, or arrange to receive, a copy of the document and provided an option to withdraw their applications` AND (`the date the written notice was given` AT MOST (`period: the last day of a number of business days after` `the date of lodgment of the supplementary document or replacement document` 2 `the public holidays`)) AND `the person took all reasonable steps to make the document available within a reasonable period`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must (A) within 2 days (excluding any Saturday, Sunday or public holiday) from the date of lodgment of the supplementary document or replacement document, give the applicants written notice of how to obtain, or arrange to receive, a copy ... and provide the applicants with an option to withdraw their applications ...; and (B) take all reasonable steps to make available within a reasonable period"

