    `the date of lodgment of the supplementary document or replacement document` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the supplementary document or replacement document lodged with the Authority?
    `the applicant notified the person making the offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you notify the person making the offer that you wish to withdraw your application?
    `the date of the notification` IS A DATE @desc On what date did you notify the person making the offer?
